title: "DC2S-V3: Dendritic Cross-Compartmental Stellar Sparsing"
abstract: "A tokenless neuromorphic Spiking Neural Network (SNN) architecture featuring hierarchical multi-compartmental stellate neurons, 15-state MoDE dynamic routing, and ALIF somas, enabling ultra-sparse continuous attractor dynamics on standard CPU hardware."
